#: fea00c84a370430a8f2c6c5abe8c618e
msgid ""
"The mock Qubes object has a collection of expected Qubes RPC calls and the "
"responses that a real system would provide. Writing these calls manually is "
"a bit tedious, given that most frontend tools query a lot of qube "
"properties. For example, on a medium-sized system, initializing Qube Manager "
"involves about 300 separate RPC calls."
msgstr ""

